===Chompy bird hunting===
Each tier of the [[Western Provinces Diary]] requires players to hunt [[Chompy bird]]s up to a certain kill count. In order to begin hunting these birds, players must complete the [[Big Chompy Bird Hunting]] quest, which requires {{SCP|Fletching|5|link=yes}} and {{SCP|Ranged|30|link=yes}} to complete. Higher Ranged levels will increase your accuracy and make hunting faster. Additionally, having {{SCP|Fletching|30|link=yes}} and starting [[Zogre Flesh Eaters]] is recommended, as this unlocks the faster-firing [[Comp ogre bow]].

It is highly recommended to talk to the [[Elder Gnome child]] to claim your diary rewards as soon as you complete each difficulty, as each tier will '''significantly increase the chance of 2 [[Chompy bird]]s appearing while hunting'''.

See the [[Chompy bird hat]] page for in-depth strategy on efficient Chompy bird hunting.

