===Slayer task assignments===
Several achievements require receiving a task from one of the [[Slayer master]]s throughout ''RuneScape''. Each Slayer master requires that the player have a certain [[Combat level]] before they can receive a task from them. Each achievement will trigger once the player accepts the assignment, so you do not need to complete the assignment that they give you - it can be blocked with [[Slayer points]] or dropped by talking to [[Turael]]/[[Aya]] in [[Burthorpe]] (though this will end your current Slayer task streak).

